arkos_lopears.aks is "Andy Severn - Lop Ears.aks" (title "Lop ears", author Targhan, composer Andy Severn), an Arkos Tracker 3 song (formatVersion 3.0, one subsong) taken 2026-11-05 from the official Arkos Tracker 3 source tree, packageFiles/songs/ArkosTracker3/, https://bitbucket.org/JulienNevo/arkostracker3 commit 14d975bdf0787cde4a5fa9425abe793e4a3a3536. The repository is MIT licensed (Copyright 2016-2024 Julien Nevo); the song ships as a bundled example and carries no separate licence. Used unchanged, only as the at3-song fixture (row I433a). No offline zxart download was available, so a zxart .aks stays for I433b/c.
